WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Build agents that show their work. Govern discovery, challenge, verification and escalation.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Assign distinct research roles.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Bind every claim to a source.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Make agents challenge each other.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Escalate unresolved disagreement.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Use only the verified answer.
